    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"GSDIG Version 3.0 is a  modification and combination of GSDIG Version 2.0 and GSDXY Version 1.0 to to add screen prompts, to support a digitizer with a one-key cursor, to make use of Hercules graphics, and to support the CONFIG.DIG files with user controlled sounds.  This provides compatiblity with GSMAP and GSDRAW Versions 6.0.\"",
